 "description": "Search the legacy MarketCheck dealer directory (one-website-per-dealer model).\n\nPrefer search_dealerships for new use cases. This endpoint is being phased out;\nuse it only when you specifically need legacy `dealer_id`-style records or the\n`listing_count_range` inventory-size filter, which is not available on the\ndealerships endpoint.\n\nFor get_sold_summary, a dealer's inventory_url here is its `source` value. This\nendpoint has no dealership-group field; use search_dealerships for group names.\n\nGeospatial: pass (latitude AND longitude) OR zip, plus radius (miles, max 7000).\n\nPagination: rows default 10, max 50; start default 0; (start * rows) cannot exceed 10000.",
